<title>NETHERLANDS: BOLSWESSANEN POOLS BELGIAN ACTIVITIES WITH REMY.</title>
<headline>BOLSWESSANEN POOLS BELGIAN ACTIVITIES WITH REMY.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch food and drinks group BolsWessanen NV said on Wednesday it would pool its distribution activities in Belgium with those of France's Remy-Cointreau .</p>
<p>The new 50-50 venture, to be called Remy-Bols, will be operational from October 1 and based in Zaventem.</p>
<p>With combined sales of 60 million guilders the new company will belong to the top five distributors of wines and spirits in Belgium, BolsWessanen said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
